bell_chime.wav ("Wind chimes")
  Model: eleven_text_to_sound_v3, 6 s requested, loop off, prompt influence 0.5.
  Prompt: "Metal wind chimes in a light breeze: a few aluminium tubes gently struck one after another, then ringing out and fading naturally to silence. Calm, sparse, close and dry. No wind noise, no background, no music."
  Take 1 of 3, generated 2026-11-11. Plan: ElevenLabs Creator (paid).
  Changes: cut to 0.015-5.8 s of the take, high-passed at 300 Hz,
  faded in and out, levelled, converted to mono 16-bit PCM WAV, 22050 Hz.

pulse_heartbeat.wav ("Heartbeat")
  Model: eleven_text_to_sound_v3, 2 s requested, loop off, prompt influence 0.5.
  Prompt: "One single human heartbeat recorded through a stethoscope: a low soft 'lub' followed a quarter second later by a slightly higher, shorter 'dub', then silence. Only one beat. Warm, deep, dry, close. No music, no hiss, no beeps."
  Take 2 of 4, generated 2026-11-11. Plan: ElevenLabs Creator (paid).
  Changes: cut to 0.495-1.13 s of the take, high-passed at 25 Hz,
  faded in and out, levelled, converted to mono 16-bit PCM WAV, 44100 Hz.

