Original modal synthesis for Meditejo, 2026: singing bowls, a temple bell, a
hand bell, tingsha, a wood block, a wooden fish and a gong, each a sum of
decaying sines with a short synthesised strike. No recorded samples.
Generated by tools/meditejo/generate_bells.py (fixed parameters and seed;
tools/meditejo/generate_bells.py --check regenerates them byte-for-byte).
